{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12678","headline":"寄源休 · 元结","name":"寄源休","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下未偃兵，儒生预戎事。\n功劳安可问，且有忝官累。\n昔常以荒浪，不敢学爲吏。\n况当在兵家，言之岂容易。\n忽然向三岭，境外爲偏帅。\n时多尚矫诈，进退多欺贰。\n纵有一直方，则上似奸智。\n谁爲明信者，能辨此劳畏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}